    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Owen Reilly is delighted to present this stunning apartment with a south facing aspect and amazing views over the Liffey and far beyond in this modern development next to the Phoenix Park, right on the doorstep of the city centre. This stylish, third floor apartment has an abundance of light flowing throughout thanks to a dual aspect orientation and is presented in turn-key condition.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises entrance hallway with storage room which leads on to a light-filled and spacious living room with floor to ceiling windows and access to a south facing balcony with far reaching panoramic views.  There are two double bedrooms with built-in wardrobes and a modern family bathroom. In the basement there is a designated and secure parking space with lift access.\r\n\r\nMore about the location..\r\n\r\nLongmeadow  is ideally located next to the Phoenix Park and within walking distance of the city centre with all it's amenities and transport links including Heuston Station, the LUAS and many bus routes. In addition the M50, providing easy access to the airport and all national routes, is also within easy reach."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Two spacious double bedrooms.\r\nBalcony with superb views over the River Liffey.\r\nSouth facing aspect.\r\nFully equipped kitchen.\r\nOpen plan living/dining area.\r\nOne designated parking space.\r\nExcellent transport links.\r\nOn the doorstep of the Phoenix Park."
      },
      {
